@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/actuator

### 노출된 Actuator API 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### 애플리케이션 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Liveness 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

### Readiness 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json
